---
description: Report on a failed run.
files:
  - files/report/template.md
  - path: files/report/collect.ps1
    as: scripts/collect.ps1
inputSchema: '{"type":"object","properties":{"run":{"type":"string"}},"required":["run"]}'
outputSchema: '{"type":"object","properties":{"diagnosis":{"type":"string"},"confidence":{"enum":["low","medium","high"]}},"required":["diagnosis","confidence"]}'
---
Use references/template.md. Return JSON matching references/output.schema.json.
